== Reference JVM and generated compatibility data ==

Scribium's development-time compatibility oracle uses the exact Eclipse
Temurin 25.0.4.1+1 JDK archive recorded in
docs/compatibility/quarkdown/reference-jvm.toml. The JDK archive is not
distributed with Scribium and no JVM is required at runtime. The generated
Unicode case-mapping values are independently captured from public
Character/String API results for the pinned oracle and are not a copy of JDK
implementation source. See the OpenJDK legal information and GPLv2 with
Classpath Exception at https://openjdk.org/legal/ and
https://openjdk.org/legal/gplv2+ce.html.

The generated case-data baseline corresponds to Unicode 16.0. Unicode,
Unicode Inc., and the Unicode logo are trademarks of Unicode, Inc.; Unicode
data licensing and notice terms are available at
https://www.unicode.org/copyright.html.

== Generated JDK/CLDR locale compatibility data ==

The locale compatibility snapshot in
crates/scribium-engine/data/jdk25_locale_display.bin and the generated locale
metadata in crates/scribium-engine/src/locale_data.rs contain values observed
from the exact Eclipse Temurin 25.0.4.1+1 CLDR provider, including JDK
FALLBACK-root values and CLDR/Unicode locale data. The JDK archive is a
generation-time input and is not distributed with Scribium. These derived
values are covered by the applicable OpenJDK GPLv2 with Classpath Exception
and CLDR/Unicode attribution and notice terms:

- OpenJDK legal information: https://openjdk.org/legal/
- GPLv2 with Classpath Exception: https://openjdk.org/legal/gplv2+ce.html
- Unicode terms: https://www.unicode.org/copyright.html

The generated values are distinguished from Scribium's independently authored
Apache-2.0 generator, binary parser, lookup code, tests, and integration; no
JDK implementation source is bundled.

== Markdown compatibility reference data ==

The checked-in CommonMark compatibility corpus is extracted from
https://github.com/commonmark/commonmark-spec at the immutable revision
recorded in tests/compat/references.toml. Its source license is CC-BY-SA-4.0;
the pinned source LICENSE file is retained and verified by the provenance
checker.

The checked-in CommonMark parser corpus uses
https://github.com/commonmark/cmark at the immutable revision recorded in
tests/compat/references.toml. The source is BSD-2-Clause licensed with the
component notices retained in its pinned COPYING file, which is verified by
the provenance checker.

The checked-in GFM parser corpus uses https://github.com/github/cmark-gfm at
the immutable revision recorded in tests/compat/references.toml. The source
is BSD-2-Clause licensed with the component notices retained in its pinned
COPYING file, which is verified by the provenance checker.
